From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 
Date: 
Subject: [PATCH] airoha-xpon: hardcode stock BWmap check control 0x00820000

Force the XG-PON MAC to use the stock AN7583 BWmap check baseline
0x00820000 (optional grant filters disabled) on every MAC initialization,
before burst profiles are published. This matches the value that makes
ACK/LOID authentication continue on AN7583/HWTC.

The write is unconditional and applied in airoha_xpon_xgpon_start_control()
right after clearing US_PROF_VLD. No module parameter or sysfs toggle is
exposed; the behavior is compiled in.
---
diff --git a/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-regs.h b/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-regs.h
index f505ff8..88d9fcc 100644
--- a/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-regs.h
+++ b/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-regs.h
@@ -137,6 +137,8 @@
 #define AIROHA_XGPON_BWM_O2349_NO_PLOAMU_ONLY_GRANT BIT(15)
 #define AIROHA_XGPON_BWM_O49_NO_DEFAULT_TCONT_GRANT BIT(16)
 #define AIROHA_XGPON_BWM_O2349_CONTINUOUS_GRANT     BIT(17)
+/* Stock AN7583 BWmap check baseline: optional grant filters disabled. */
+#define AIROHA_XGPON_BWM_CHK_CTRL_STOCK 0x00820000
 
 /*
  * Bits 3 and 4 select hardware generation and verification of OMCI MIC with
diff --git a/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-xgpon.c b/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-xgpon.c
index fb86a12..e7661e4 100644
--- a/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-xgpon.c
+++ b/airoha-xpon/src/airoha-xpon-xgpon.c
@@ -415,6 +415,8 @@ static int airoha_xpon_xgpon_start_control(struct airoha_xpon *xpon)
 	airoha_xpon_xgpon_counters_start(xpon);
 	airoha_xpon_xgpon_release_mac_interfaces(xpon);
 	airoha_xgpon_write(xpon, AIROHA_XGPON_US_PROF_VLD, 0);
+	airoha_xgpon_write(xpon, AIROHA_XGPON_DBG_BWM_CHK_CTRL,
+	                   AIROHA_XGPON_BWM_CHK_CTRL_STOCK);
 	airoha_xgpon_update_bits(xpon, AIROHA_XGPON_RSP_TIME,
 	                         AIROHA_XGPON_RESPONSE_TIME_MASK, 0x551);
 	airoha_xgpon_update_bits(xpon, AIROHA_XGPON_O23_O4_PLOAMU_CTRL,
--
